=== case_id ===
Case-05-001-v1

=== 用户原始指令 (query.txt) ===
生成一个会议入会卡片，显示会议时间和ID，还要显示会议的实时屏幕共享内容和聊天消息。

=== TaskSpec 契约 (task.taskSpec.json) ===
{
  "userQuery": "生成一个会议入会卡片，显示会议时间和ID，还要显示会议的实时屏幕共享内容和聊天消息。",
  "size": "2x4",
  "eventCandidates": [
    {
      "call": "clickToIntent",
      "args": {
        "intentName": "ViewCalendarEvent",
        "params": {
          "entityId": "/data/calendar/items/0/entityId"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "dataModel": {
    "value": {
      "data": {
        "calendar": {
          "items": [
            {
              "entityName": "calendar",
              "entityId": "mock-meeting-05001",
              "title": "产品评审会",
              "eventLocation": "线上会议",
              "description": "会议ID 863 245 901",
              "dtStart": "14:30",
              "dtEnd": "15:15"
            }
          ]
        },
        "meeting": {
          "idLabel": "会议ID",
